[Start Game]
    ↓
[Initialize Board]
    ↓
[Spawn Tetromino]
    ↓
[Is Game Over?] ← No ← [Move/Rotate Tetromino]
    ↓ Yes              [Detect Collision?]
[Display Game Over]   [Block Placed]
    ↓                  [Check Full Rows]
[End]                  [Erase Rows / Update Board]
                       [P Key Pressed?] → [Pause/Resume]
